WEBVTT

00:23.410 --> 00:30.380
It's right before your eyes... Just a little more...

00:30.630 --> 00:35.470
Your dream is right there.

00:36.180 --> 00:41.390
Only a small hunch...

00:41.640 --> 00:45.480
...keeps your hopes up now.

00:45.730 --> 00:50.860
In this endless, dark maze,

00:50.980 --> 00:54.990
strength is realizing...

00:55.740 --> 00:57.780
...your own weakness.

00:57.780 --> 01:01.120
Taking in the shining wind,

01:01.120 --> 01:06.120
you can fly...

01:06.670 --> 01:08.880
...towards the vast sky.

01:11.960 --> 01:15.970
When even the deepest darkness turns into light...

01:16.050 --> 01:23.560
...I believe in that instant.

01:24.230 --> 01:27.810
I'll keep on believing...

01:57.220 --> 01:58.430
Maron...

01:59.470 --> 02:01.180
You knew...?

02:01.180 --> 02:02.140
Yeah.

02:02.140 --> 02:06.680
It can't be... Chiaki is Sinbad?

02:06.680 --> 02:10.230
And you knew I was Jeanne...

02:10.230 --> 02:11.270
Listen to me!

02:11.270 --> 02:14.320
No! This can't be!

02:15.070 --> 02:16.280
This...

02:16.280 --> 02:18.030
This means nothing!!!

02:21.490 --> 02:22.830
Maron!

02:27.000 --> 02:28.960
That was too easy.

02:28.960 --> 02:32.880
Jeanne's barrier is weakenend by her emotional distress.

02:32.880 --> 02:36.840
It appears that God didn't realize that human emotions are a weakness.

02:39.380 --> 02:43.890
Confession of Separation! I'm Not Going to Trust Anyone!!

02:46.720 --> 02:48.690
<i>Fin...</i>

02:56.440 --> 03:04.780
Answer me! Tell me, Fin... What should I do?

03:10.500 --> 03:15.090
<i>I...was always by myself.</i>

03:16.670 --> 03:18.590
<i>I was lonely...</i>

03:19.670 --> 03:22.300
I was really lonely.

03:37.480 --> 03:39.490
Gratin

03:41.780 --> 03:46.120
<i>Chiaki was just taking advantage of my loneliness...</i>

03:47.490 --> 03:49.700
<i>It was all just a lie?!</i>

04:08.470 --> 04:11.770
<i>Was it all just a lie?!</i>

04:11.770 --> 04:14.270
<i>- I just don't want you to get hurt. Hurry! Go!</i>

04:13.310 --> 04:16.900
<i>- You're just teasing me.</i>

04:14.270 --> 04:16.900
<i>- No, I'm not. I'm serious.</i>

04:16.900 --> 04:18.440
<i>When you're lonely...</i>

04:18.440 --> 04:20.740
<i>When you're hurt, it's okay to cry.</i>

04:20.740 --> 04:22.530
<i>I want you to quit being a Kaitou.</i>

04:24.950 --> 04:27.410
<i>Was it all just a lie?</i>

04:27.410 --> 04:30.240
Hey, Fin! Answer me! Fin!

04:33.330 --> 04:34.960
<i>Sinbad is your enemy.</i>

04:35.750 --> 04:39.500
<i>The Demons were brought to this world by Sinbad and Access.</i>

04:39.500 --> 04:43.050
<i>Be careful, Jeanne. Don't be fooled!</i>

04:43.840 --> 04:47.800
<i>He really was deceiving me...</i>

04:47.800 --> 04:52.930
<i>Taking advantage of my loneliness and trying to manipulate me.</i>

04:54.810 --> 04:57.360
- Maron. Maron!

04:57.360 --> 04:57.980
Maron!!!

05:41.900 --> 05:43.610
<i>Hello, Kusakabe residence.</i>

05:43.610 --> 05:49.320
<i>I'm out right now. Please leave a message after the beep:</i>

05:50.580 --> 05:53.490
<i>Maron! You're there, aren't you, Maron?!</i>

05:53.490 --> 05:58.500
<i>Answer the phone! Please! Listen to my story!</i>

05:58.500 --> 06:00.290
<i>Maron?</i>

06:06.010 --> 06:09.300
Man, Sinbad... Give up already.

06:10.760 --> 06:14.310
It's for the best! What are you worried about?

06:14.310 --> 06:16.140
Will you leave me alone?

06:58.310 --> 07:00.440
I'm going!

07:02.730 --> 07:05.320
Chiaki, what are you doing?

07:05.320 --> 07:06.690
Good morning.

07:06.690 --> 07:08.900
You're not with Maron?

07:08.900 --> 07:09.820
Huh?

07:09.820 --> 07:11.990
I got a call early in the morning.

07:11.990 --> 07:14.990
She said: "I have something to do, so I won't be going to school today."

07:14.990 --> 07:19.620
I thought: "How dare she skip school!"

07:19.620 --> 07:24.290
But I forgave her, thinking you two went on a date.

07:25.040 --> 07:26.460
Do you know where she went?!

07:26.460 --> 07:27.170
Huh?

07:28.210 --> 07:29.720
Did something happen?

07:29.720 --> 07:31.010
You don't know...

07:31.010 --> 07:33.840
How would I know something like that!

07:33.840 --> 07:34.640
Huh?

07:45.440 --> 07:48.530
Lovers' quarrel... Geez!

07:49.780 --> 07:51.900
I'm jealous...

07:53.360 --> 08:02.120
After saying goodbye to that sky, I begin my journey.

08:02.120 --> 08:12.760
For me, the changing colors of the city really make me sad.

08:06.840 --> 08:07.340
Maron...

08:08.630 --> 08:09.710
<i>Maron!</i>

08:15.300 --> 08:18.850
<i>Maron... Where are you, Maron?!</i>

08:19.220 --> 08:28.320
In the corner of the park, your head was hanging low.

08:24.810 --> 08:26.230
<i>Where are you?!</i>

08:28.230 --> 08:29.650
Maron!

08:28.320 --> 08:35.990
I was starting to feel something from the sign of my heart.

08:37.200 --> 08:45.960
The most important thing is to stay true to your heart.

08:45.960 --> 08:54.800
When the sky embraces the stars, and they begin to fall asleep...

08:52.210 --> 08:54.010
<i>Me...!</i>

08:54.010 --> 08:55.300
<i>Trust me!</i>

08:54.800 --> 09:03.600
...the love that burst out of our hands starts to walk.

08:56.760 --> 08:57.640
Maron!

09:03.600 --> 09:12.230
Beyond the sky, you can see tomorrow.

09:12.230 --> 09:21.990
Let's cherish the future that awaits the both of us.

09:38.140 --> 09:39.800
Wait, Maron!

09:39.800 --> 09:44.480
I understand why you're angry but at least talk to me!

09:44.480 --> 09:48.020
I'm sorry for keeping my identity as Sinbad a secret.

09:49.060 --> 09:50.060
But...!

09:50.060 --> 09:51.400
Tell me, Chiaki.

09:53.480 --> 09:56.780
When you said "Let's be together," was that a lie?

09:56.780 --> 10:00.410
Did you approach me because you knew I was Jeanne?!

10:02.870 --> 10:05.580
<i>Please Chiaki, say it isn't true...</i>

10:05.580 --> 10:12.380
<i>Say it wasn't a lie. That you didn't know I was Jeanne... Say it was just a coincidence!</i>

10:13.500 --> 10:14.130
It's true...

10:15.590 --> 10:19.260
I approached you because I knew you were Jeanne.

10:22.050 --> 10:28.940
I thought the best way to stop you being a Kaitou was to make you fall in love with me.

10:28.940 --> 10:30.100
However...

10:30.100 --> 10:34.190
Listen to me, Maron! At first, that was how I felt.

10:34.190 --> 10:38.240
I couldn't believe in love and affection!

10:39.200 --> 10:41.200
But now it's different!

10:41.200 --> 10:44.580
Stop! That's enough! I don't want to hear it!

10:45.330 --> 10:50.370
Don't hurt me anymore! I've had enough!

10:52.080 --> 10:55.920
I...I'm not going to trust anyone!<i></i>

11:00.590 --> 11:01.890
Maron...

11:03.140 --> 11:06.180
That's not it, Maron...

11:16.280 --> 11:17.940
I-I'm sorry!

11:17.940 --> 11:22.110
Oh, don't worry. I'm just passing time.

11:27.200 --> 11:29.410
I don't know what happened...

11:30.830 --> 11:35.090
But when something sad happens, you should look at flowers.

11:35.090 --> 11:36.170
You'll feel better.

11:37.050 --> 11:38.920
Flowers are strong.

11:38.920 --> 11:42.890
They can withstand wind or rain.

11:42.890 --> 11:47.680
They just sincerely wait for blossoming season to come.

11:50.310 --> 11:53.440
<i>Just...sincerely...</i>

12:02.570 --> 12:04.950
Thank you, Ojii-san.

12:02.570 --> 12:07.870
Ojii-san = Grandfather

12:04.950 --> 12:07.870
Oh, no. No need for thanks.

12:20.590 --> 12:22.800
What's so great about flowers?

12:52.330 --> 12:58.340
<i>Geez! Where did Maron and Chiaki go?</i>

12:58.340 --> 12:59.750
<i>Did they just...</i>

12:59.750 --> 13:01.010
Toudaiji-san!

13:01.010 --> 13:03.590
Huh? Yes?

13:03.590 --> 13:06.300
Is my class boring?

13:06.300 --> 13:08.930
O-Oh, no!

13:08.930 --> 13:11.390
I see. Thank you.

13:20.520 --> 13:23.940
<i>I must forget everything. It was all a dream.</i>

13:23.940 --> 13:29.120
<i>Nothing has changed. I was all alone to begin with.</i>

13:42.340 --> 13:44.760
<i>What am I doing?!</i>

13:44.760 --> 13:49.600
<i>Because I trusted someone, I was hurt when they betrayed me.</i>

13:50.390 --> 13:54.930
<i>I don't want to cry anymore! Aren't I supposed to be strong?!</i>

13:56.560 --> 13:59.230
<i>Maron, don't cry anymore!</i>

13:59.900 --> 14:02.860
<i>You have to survive on your own from now on!</i>

14:07.650 --> 14:12.330
<i>Without relying on anyone! I'm not lonely! I'm not lonely!</i>

14:12.330 --> 14:14.290
<i>I'm not...!</i>

14:14.700 --> 14:18.420
<i>That's right! I was all alone to begin with!</i>

14:18.420 --> 14:20.420
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

14:20.420 --> 14:22.420
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

14:22.420 --> 14:24.550
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

14:30.340 --> 14:33.720
Kusakabe! That was an excellent performance!

14:33.720 --> 14:37.140
You finally decided to practise seriously!

14:37.140 --> 14:38.560
Uh...yes!

14:38.560 --> 14:42.360
You got ahead by skipping class and practicing!

14:42.360 --> 14:45.980
I was desperate to work up a sweat...

14:45.980 --> 14:48.780
I understand, Kusakabe!

14:48.780 --> 14:52.030
You wanted to expend your excess energy through sports!

14:52.030 --> 14:54.030
It's very healthy!

14:54.030 --> 14:56.830
Now, everyone. Time for practice!

14:56.830 --> 14:57.700
Yes, ma'am!!!

14:58.460 --> 15:01.630
Hey Maron, did something happen between Chiaki and you?

15:01.630 --> 15:02.170
Huh?

15:02.460 --> 15:04.250
Not really.

15:04.250 --> 15:07.920
<i>I'm strong. I am strong enough to live on my own.</i>

15:07.920 --> 15:13.220
"Not really?" Then why did you skip school to practice?

15:13.220 --> 15:16.100
So that I won't lose against you.

15:16.100 --> 15:20.940
Whaaat?! You <i>were</i> trying to get ahead! That's not fair!

15:20.940 --> 15:22.440
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

15:22.440 --> 15:24.570
Now, practice! Practice!

15:25.230 --> 15:28.530
<i>This is how it should be. This is...</i>

15:31.530 --> 15:32.870
Momokuri!

15:32.870 --> 15:35.530
- Fight!

15:33.200 --> 15:35.530
Go!

15:35.530 --> 15:38.620
What? You were practicing gymnastics?

15:38.620 --> 15:40.830
You even skipped class to...

15:40.830 --> 15:44.590
Oh, I get it! You want to enter the Olympics!

15:44.590 --> 15:47.300
I'll be cheering you on!

15:47.300 --> 15:51.510
Oh, no. The Olympics? It's nothing like that.

15:51.510 --> 15:53.260
- Then what is it?

15:55.220 --> 15:59.810
Geez, Chiaki. What were <i>you</i> doing all this time while skipping school?

16:00.100 --> 16:02.640
I had a sudden urge to see the ocean.

16:02.640 --> 16:05.770
Hey, Maron. Why don't we go see the ocean?

16:05.770 --> 16:07.980
You must be kidding!

16:07.980 --> 16:10.360
Just the two of us going to see the ocean?

16:10.360 --> 16:13.320
It's like an old high school movie!

16:13.320 --> 16:18.290
Besides, it's not at all romantic to go with a pervert like you!

16:19.200 --> 16:26.000
Same here. It wasn't like I was thinking of doing anything romantic with you.

16:26.000 --> 16:29.920
I'd have more fun walking a dog.

16:29.920 --> 16:32.930
Then why don't you go find a dog that'll accompany you?

16:32.930 --> 16:34.590
Yeah, that's what I'll do.

16:34.930 --> 16:39.810
Um, what's the matter with you two? Are you two fight--

16:39.810 --> 16:44.270
It's their problem. You shouldn't interfere in a lovers' quarrel.

16:51.940 --> 16:54.660
I want to talk to you, Maron!

16:54.660 --> 16:55.990
Miyako!

16:55.990 --> 17:00.240
I just remembered something, so I'm going to take a detour before I go home!

17:00.240 --> 17:02.000
Okay! See you later!

17:07.330 --> 17:09.960
<i>Please, just leave me alone!</i>

17:11.050 --> 17:12.800
<i>Leave me alone!</i>

17:22.140 --> 17:24.730
Looks like it's time to say goodbye, Jeanne.

17:31.230 --> 17:34.320
What's the matter? Where's Ojii-san?

17:34.320 --> 17:36.910
Where are you going?! Wait!

17:44.500 --> 17:47.330
Is Ojii-san in here?

17:54.590 --> 17:57.260
Hey, Sinbad! Open up!

17:57.260 --> 17:59.470
I found a Demon!

17:59.470 --> 18:00.430
What did you say?!

18:01.050 --> 18:04.890
Kitty! Where did you go?

18:08.730 --> 18:11.480
What's the matter, Ojii-san?! Wake up!

18:11.480 --> 18:12.820
Ojii-san!

18:18.490 --> 18:20.780
<i>You fell right into my trap, Jeanne!</i>

18:20.780 --> 18:22.830
<i>You are going to die here!</i>

18:23.990 --> 18:25.700
Ojii-san, I'm sorry!

18:30.080 --> 18:34.960
Why did you do such a...?! What did this man ever do?!

18:34.960 --> 18:39.930
<i>You should be worrying more about yourself than him, Jeanne.</i>

18:45.350 --> 18:47.520
<i>Fin, lend me you power!</i>

18:47.520 --> 18:50.100
<i>Deliver my wish to Jeanne d'Arc!</i>

19:11.630 --> 19:13.880
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

19:13.880 --> 19:16.090
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

19:16.090 --> 19:17.710
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

19:24.430 --> 19:29.020
<i>Kaitou Jeanne has arrived by the order of God!</i>

19:33.520 --> 19:35.570
You've finally shown your true form.

19:37.190 --> 19:38.440
<i>How foolish.</i>

19:51.040 --> 19:53.670
Why couldn't I dodge such an easy attack?!

19:54.920 --> 19:58.630
<i>You're no match now that your barrier is weakened.</i>

19:58.630 --> 20:01.930
Barrier?! That has nothing to do with it!

20:01.930 --> 20:04.430
I won't lose, no matter what!

20:04.430 --> 20:11.060
<i>Your heart is in chaos. That chaos is weakening your barrier.</i>

20:15.860 --> 20:17.860
<i>Die, Jeanne!</i>

20:22.400 --> 20:24.110
Mind your own business!

20:24.110 --> 20:27.240
Don't be foolish! You can't win in your current state!

20:27.240 --> 20:29.830
Don't interfere anymore!

20:29.830 --> 20:31.370
Just leave me alone!

20:31.910 --> 20:33.500
I can't leave you alone...

20:36.380 --> 20:40.420
<i>Then, I'll lead you both into eternal darkness!</i>

20:44.760 --> 20:47.550
C-Chiaki!

20:53.060 --> 20:56.270
<i>Humans are so fragile.</i>

20:56.270 --> 20:58.690
<i>Hearts are distorted and run by emotion.</i>

20:58.690 --> 21:02.690
<i>Is that the human weakness? How pathetic...</i>

21:04.030 --> 21:06.570
<i>This will finish you! Die!</i>

21:08.780 --> 21:09.490
<i>What the...!</i>

21:13.290 --> 21:15.420
I won't forgive you...!

21:15.420 --> 21:16.370
<i>Take this!</i>

21:20.050 --> 21:21.460
<i>I-Impossible...</i>

21:25.430 --> 21:27.010
In the name of God...

21:29.470 --> 21:31.520
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

21:34.480 --> 21:37.020
I seal you here!

21:46.950 --> 21:48.620
<i>Checkmate!</i>

21:55.540 --> 21:57.500
<i>Collection completed!</i>

22:14.810 --> 22:16.430
Maron...

22:19.900 --> 22:22.860
Chiaki, goodbye...

22:28.660 --> 22:35.290
The thick clouds past and the descending light...

22:36.040 --> 22:44.710
...slowly melts the hardened, damaged past.

22:45.300 --> 22:49.220
Because we live so stiffly,

22:49.220 --> 22:52.890
it's so easy to smash into pieces.

22:53.100 --> 23:02.060
And I never thought that I had anything to protect...

23:02.610 --> 23:05.780
Never forgetting...

23:06.070 --> 23:09.900
...there is unending love.

23:10.570 --> 23:14.660
I'll catch it, I'll steal it.

23:14.830 --> 23:17.910
Then embrace you with it.

23:18.200 --> 23:21.170
Even if there comes a time...

23:21.630 --> 23:26.090
...when this planet is destroyed,

23:26.300 --> 23:30.180
I won't be lonely, I won't be alone.

23:30.380 --> 23:37.930
I'll be embracing an eternal wind.

23:47.780 --> 23:50.070
Another person close to me is being possessed by a Demon...

23:50.070 --> 23:54.030
Fin! How long is this battle going to continue?! When will it end?!

23:54.030 --> 24:02.420
Be confused! Suffer! As your heart becomes weaker and weaker, so does the barrier of God become thinner and thinner.

24:02.420 --> 24:07.960
I never want to see anyone precious to me hurt again! Your actions are unforgivable!

24:07.960 --> 24:11.260
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne -  Jeanne: Revival of the Power of Love!

24:12.130 --> 24:14.140
I won't lose... Never!
